.TH tksqlite n 0.28.0 tkutils "Tcl/Tk Utility Library"
.SH NAME
tkutils::tksqlite \- SQLite table browser (optional; requires sqlite3)
.SH SYNOPSIS
package require tkutils::tksqlite
.br
set w [::tkutils::tksqlite::widget .w]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Lists database tables and shows rows of the selected table. Uses the external
sqlite3 package, so this widget is optional and not loaded by the umbrella.
See docs/tksqlite.md.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
tclutils(n)
.SH KEYWORDS
Tk, widget, sqlite, database
